7	PO7	Environment and Sustainability: Understand the impact of professional engineering solutions	1
8	PO8	Ethics: Apply ethical principles and commit to professional ethics	1
9	PO9	Individual and Team Work: Function effectively as an individual and in teams	1
10	PO10	Communication: Communicate effectively on complex engineering activities	1
11	PO11	Project Management: Demonstrate knowledge and understanding of management principles	1
